    <innerclass refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_wiki_chunk_splitter" prot="public">themis::llm::WikiChunkSplitter</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis">themis</innernamespace>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis_1_1llm">themis::llm</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Heading-aware Markdown chunk splitter for the LLM Wiki index. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>WikiChunkSplitter</computeroutput> parses Markdown source text into <computeroutput>WikiChunk</computeroutput> objects using a heading-aware sliding-window strategy:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Lines are accumulated under the nearest ancestor heading.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>When a section exceeds <computeroutput>max_tokens</computeroutput>, the buffer is flushed into chunks of at most <computeroutput>max_tokens</computeroutput> tokens with an <computeroutput>overlap_tokens</computeroutput> sliding tail.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Each chunk receives a stable <computeroutput>chunk_id</computeroutput> derived from a FNV-64 hash of <computeroutput>(file_path + ":" + section_title + ":" + seq_idx)</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Token counting uses the same <computeroutput>[A-Za-z0-9_\-]+</computeroutput> regex as the Python MVP.</para>
<sect1 id="wiki__chunk__splitter_8h_1autotoc_md26_1s1"><sect2 id="wiki__chunk__splitter_8h_1autotoc_md26">
<title>Example</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">WikiChunkSplitter<sp/>splitter(220,<sp/>40);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>chunks<sp/>=<sp/>splitter.split(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;docs/arch.md&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>content);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>chunks[0].chunk_id<sp/>==<sp/>&quot;3f9a2b1c0d4e-0&quot;<sp/><sp/>(deterministic)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
